  "description": "Automation Orchestrator version of the AMI Golden Meter demo for utilities. A meter tamper / baseline variance is validated by OPA, triaged by an AI agent that determines whether the change is a bad actor or an authorized change, routed by the OPA policy verdict (the AI recommends; OPA decides), gated by human approval for critical assets, escalated to a CIP-008 incident for a suspected bad actor, remediated by rollback, and closed with signed (CAA) evidence.",
  "schema_version": "2.0.0"
